{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863470940183724082","content":"'I know. I just... needed to ask.'","created_at":"2021-08-08T16:17:49.677000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"873963222422663168","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863470940183724082","content":"she takes another deep breath, and,\n'...my sister. I... don't even remember her name... or anything... I just remember... I wasn't watching. Coyotes attacked. I tried to shoot them... I... missed... horribly...'","created_at":"2021-08-08T16:21:27.424000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"873964135719776266","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863470940183724082","content":"'All I know after that... is running... I don't know if I even waited for our parents... I just... ran. Fled. Sold my soul to a ***Thing*** just so I could forget. Funny how that worked out, huh...'","created_at":"2021-08-08T16:22:15.915000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"873964339105783879","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"863470940183724082","content":"\"I see.\" Pause. \"The way I see it, coyotes would've gotten her. You still did what you could in that moment.\"\nRoy shakes his head and says quietly, to himself: \"I'll really stick to a bow...\"","created_at":"2021-08-08T16:27:17.773000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"873965605190000701","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
