{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863470940183724082","content":"'...how much do guns h-hurt, though? And t-the pain of... betrayal... s-she was only t-two...'","created_at":"2021-08-08T16:33:01.972000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"873967048865239061","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"863470940183724082","content":"\"I'm no expert on guns, as you could probably gather, but I suppose it'd depend on the gun. How old was she?\"","created_at":"2021-08-08T16:35:53.811000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"873967769610248243","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863470940183724082","content":"'T-two... years...'","created_at":"2021-08-08T16:36:25.986000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"873967904561971261","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"863470940183724082","content":"\"Right. Not sure how it is with others, but our people, even though we grow kinda quicker than others, aren't really at a point to have a deep understanding of stuff like betrayal and such.\"","created_at":"2021-08-08T16:37:37.753000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"873968205574578227","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863470940183724082","content":"'...I robbed her of that chance... and our parents... what happened to them? I don't... remember...'","created_at":"2021-08-08T16:40:49.656000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"873969010474110996","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863470940183724082","content":"she lets out a croaky scream of anguish.","created_at":"2021-08-08T16:41:02.464000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"873969064194748446","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"863470940183724082","content":"\"We can't change the past, but even then. Let's assume you hadn't tried to shoot. What then? Would the coyotes have spared her? Or if you had run right up to them. Would they have spared you both?\"","created_at":"2021-08-08T16:43:53.100000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"873969779893997578","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863470940183724082","content":"'...I... don't know... I don't know... I don't... know...'","created_at":"2021-08-08T16:44:21.783000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"873969900199219211","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863470940183724082","content":"'I remember... just little enough... to where I don't know anything...'","created_at":"2021-08-08T16:44:34.747000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"873969954574184519","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"863470940183724082","content":"\"We don't have coyotes back home, but we have wolves. Wolves wouldn't have done either. You probably have done the best you could have at that moment.\"","created_at":"2021-08-08T16:46:08.563000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"873970348066996254","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863470940183724082","content":"'...but I still... fled. Abandoned her. Maybe if I... had stayed... I could have worked at a temple in return... for her life back...'","created_at":"2021-08-08T16:47:47.433000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"873970762757861396","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"863470940183724082","content":"\"But right now you don't remember if there was any temple or anything like that available. And wild beasts don't really tend to come close to towns unless they really have to. You might have been completely on your own there.\"","created_at":"2021-08-08T16:49:41.130000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"873971239637643344","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
